meta {
  name: Set Rate Countries
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

put {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/private/shipping/methods/{{shippingMethodId}}/rates/{{shippingRateId}}/countries
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "countryCodes": ["PT", "ES"]
  }
}

docs {
  Requires an ADMIN session (run Public/Auth/Login (Admin) first). Anonymous -> 401, USER -> 403.

  Replaces the FULL set of countries the rate applies to (transactional). Duplicates are
  deduped; unknown country codes -> 400; unknown rate -> 404. An empty array is allowed but
  leaves the rate unselectable at checkout. Returns the rate with its resulting countryCodes.
}
